# ── Android / TWA build (Bubblewrap) ─────────────────────────────────────────
# .vercelignore keeps these off the deployed SITE. This keeps them out of the
# public GitHub repo, which is the other way the signing key could escape — and
# the worse one, since git history is permanent.
# 🚫 Never add .well-known/ here: assetlinks.json must be committed and public.
*.keystore
*.jks
app/
.gradle/
gradle/
gradlew
gradlew.bat
build.gradle
settings.gradle
gradle.properties
local.properties
*.apk
*.aab
twa-manifest.json
store_icon.png
manifest-checksum.txt
